# 📊 **Sales Data Analysis Project**

This project analyzes monthly sales data to identify trends and visualize product performance across different products and months.

This project performs data analysis and visualization on monthly product sales data. The goal is to explore the dataset, identify missing values, and visualize sales trends across different products.

## 🛠 Setup & Run Instructions

1. **Clone or Download the Repository**

```
git clone https://github.com/your-username/sales-data-analysis.git
```

2. **Navigate to Project Folder**

```
cd sales-data-analysis
```

3. **Install Required Libraries**

```
pip install pandas numpy matplotlib
```

4. **Run the Script / Notebook**

```
python sales_analysis.py
```

